// one, carrying the raw ore's grade and metal units unchanged (metalUnitsByType repeats the pack's
// units, patches/oreprocessing-ore.json, held to it by the pack tests), 16 a stack like every rock
// form (#863). Smelts by its grade, a sulfide's not until roasted (set in code). The texture is the
// ore's nugget texture on vanilla's crushed shape, poor ore's lighter (fine-grained). Marked disabled
// with the switch off.
